repository-code: 'https://github.com/ProgrmerJack/Public-Procurement-Control-Surface'
url: 'https://github.com/ProgrmerJack/Public-Procurement-Control-Surface'
abstract: >-
  A two-part open resource for measuring competition in EU public
  procurement across two generations of reporting systems. Part A is a
  contract-level competition–carbon panel (21.6M carbon-mapped contracts,
  27 territories, 2012–2023) rebuilt from the harmonised TED
  contract-award-notice layer, with a deterministically rebuilt
  country×CPV×month single-bidding panel, a CPV→EXIOBASE carbon weight
  validated against Eurostat, and Directive 2014/24 transposition dates.
  Part B is a full-bid-set corpus parsed from EU eForms (302,555
  single-award notices, 2024–2025) giving the complete ranked tenderer set
  per award, with a pre-registered worked example.
keywords:
  - public procurement
  - Tenders Electronic Daily
  - eForms
  - single bidding
  - competition
  - EXIOBASE
  - carbon intensity
  - green public procurement
  - full bid set
  - open contracting
